# TeamFlow frontend (optional) — copy to .env in the repository root if needed.
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle (never put secrets here).
# For production, set VITE_API_URL before `npm run build` (Vite bakes it into the client bundle).

# Local dev default: API at http://localhost:4000 (see src/lib/api/client.ts)
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000

# Production example (use your public API origin, no trailing slash):
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
